      "Third-party testing is a brand claim, with no named lab",
      "No sport certification we could confirm",
      "Larger scoop and more calories per gram of protein than an isolate"
    ],
    "bottomLine": "The cheapest branded bulk whey that still discloses a full label and claims third-party testing.",
